     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div><br></div><div>Working with 2 or more selectInput, I had found an odd behavior on Firefox and IE, if you see this example in those browsers you will see the problem <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/basic-datatable.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/basic-datatable.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389515012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EGI_JQ0e1eqLwOqIPL9iI\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/basic-datatable.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>When you try to tab over the dropdowns, the navigation won&#39;t go further the first one, and investigating further I found as well that the problem is caused if you have more than one parameter on <span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;All&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">, </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">unique</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.character</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpg</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">cyl</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">), F</span>or example, if you delete the second parameter &quot;<span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">unique</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.character</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpg</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">cyl</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:inherit;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>&quot;, the tab navigation will continue with no problems. Is this a bug? Have been addressed before? Any comments will be appreciate. </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for taking your time to read.</div></div>"
